Vendored JavaScript engine: quickjs-ng

Source: https://github.com/quickjs-ng/quickjs
Release: v0.16.1
License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)

Only the core engine is vendored (quickjs.c, libregexp.c, libunicode.c,
dtoa.c and their headers). quickjs-libc is deliberately NOT included:
scripts executed by w3m run in a sandbox with no native I/O; the only
host access goes through the shim in ../js.c.
